--- !u!114 &149396164
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 149396162}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1211e0c62a2a87d44a39dd4bee387c5a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 2122925843}
  diggingLayers:
  - {fileID: 347229275}
  - {fileID: 1259930559}
  - {fileID: 1353298952}
  - {fileID: 560945369}
  - {fileID: 666441787}
  - {fileID: 608101256}
  - {fileID: 779876757}
  pressBar: {fileID: 227250639}
  barCanvas: {fileID: 593476663}
  timingBars:
  - {fileID: 1407638246}
  - {fileID: 227250640}
  - {fileID: 593476666}
  endingLines:
  - 'Deserter: And there it is. The body of Magnus'' father.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Are you sure this is going to work?'
  - 'Deserter: I''m more than certain. Wanna do the honors?'
  - '!<NAME>!: Yeah, let''s do this.'
  endingLines2:
  - 'Deserter: Well done, you guys! We finally have a real shot at taking down Magnus.'
  - 'Deserter: You will have your revenge, and I will become the hero that saved
    the continent!'
  - 'Deserter: So what is your plan, now?'
  - '!<NAME>!: We have to get back to the castle, however we must avoid Volsen at
    all cost.'
  - '!<NAME>!: I don''t want to face the consequences of my actions again...'
  - 'Ponter: What did I tell you, !<NAME>!? Get a grip, you''ll have more than enough
    time to cry when we deal with Magnus.'
  - 'Ponter: We''re going straight to the castle through the near forest, and we
    end it once and for all.'
  - 'Ponter: Got it, !<NAME>!?'
  - '!<NAME>!: Yeah...'
  - '!<NAME>!: How are we supposed to use the soul?'
  - 'Deserter: If what I learned is true, when we all face Magnus, we have to weaken
    him enough to open his heart.'
  - 'Deserter: He will try to reach deep within it to grab the last remnants of his
    human power inside his soul.'
  - 'Deserter: That''s when we''ll have the chance to connect the other part of his
    soul, that will push out the demon darkness that replaced it.'
  - '!<NAME>!: I understand. I suppose this is our last chance to get him down...'
  - '!<NAME>!: Let''s not waste any time. Let''s get going.'
  endingLines_2:
  - '!<NAME>!: Well, there''s the body we were looking for.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Let''s pray that whatever the deserter said is true.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Ehh...'
  - '!<NAME>!: There it goes...'
  endingLines2_2:
  - 'Ponter: You should have spared him. He sounded genuine to me.'
  - 'Ponter: It''s another instance of you making decisions too rashly.'
  - '!<NAME>!: He used to serve Magnus. No one that chose to do so deserves to live.'
  - 'Ponter: Perhaps, but don''t you think we could still find him useful? And get
    rid of him later?'
  - 'Ponter: Now, we don''t even know how we''re supposed to use the soul.'
  - 'Ponter: Should we force it inside Magnus? Should we burn it? Should we show
    it to his face?'
  - 'Ponter: We''re lacking a very important information, because you chose to act
    like the big man, again!'
  - 'Ponter: Was Volsen not enough for you?!'
  - '!<NAME>!: It was enough for me! That''s why I''m not taking any more chances,
    and when I see a Magnus knight, I strike him down.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Simple as.'
  - 'Ponter: Ehh... I understand, but we have no idea what to do with the soul now.'
  - '!<NAME>!: We will figure it out when the soul is needed.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Now let''s get going and destroy Magnus.'
  dialoguePlayer: {fileID: 448676914}
  fire: {fileID: 2109093229}
  soulTaking: {fileID: 731764216}
