--- !u!114 &1991861319
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1991861318}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ebf3217f620b18644a831677ebe32af8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  dialgouePlayer: {fileID: 448676914}
  blackoutManager: {fileID: 1515575365}
  player: {fileID: 339415503}
  ponter: {fileID: 1112044694}
  deserter: {fileID: 850474147}
  introLines:
  - '!<NAME>!: ...'
  - 'Ponter: ...'
  - 'Ponter: What are you thinking about?'
  - '!<NAME>!: About my choices. I''m the sole reason for Volsen''s fall.'
  - '!<NAME>!: All the people that lived there. All our friends... Their blood is
    on my hands.'
  - '!<NAME>!: It all started with me getting caught during my last mission... Then
    causing the fire in the castle...'
  - '!<NAME>!: And lastly, taking the bait... I can''t believe I was so stupid...'
  - 'Ponter: I''m as devastated as you are, but what''s done is done. We have to
    learn from our mistakes and move on.'
  - '!<NAME>!: We have absolutely zero leads... We can''t get to any place mentioned
    in the book. We''re as good as dead.'
  - 'Ponter: I never thought you''d give up so easily. Get a grip and let''s start
    planning our next moves.'
  - 'Ponter: As long as we''re alive, our mission is still ongoing.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Wait! Someone''s coming!'
  - 'Ponter: Huh?'
  - '!<NAME>!: They found us! We have to run!'
  - '???: No, no, no, wait. This is a misunderstanding. I''m not a part of any group
    that was looking for you.'
  - 'Ponter: Then who are you?! You''re wearing a Magnus'' armor!'
  - '???: I used to be a Magnus'' knight, but those times are long gone. Same as
    Magnus'' soul. I''m the only deserter of his army that still lives.'
  - '!<NAME>!: You look... human. How is it possible, we thought Magnus'' army is
    posessed by demons.'
  - 'Deserter: And it is. I managed to escape before he turned everyone into a demon
    slave. I could not accept it, so I ran.'
  - 'Ponter: Huh. Well, anyway, we''re trying to come up with a new plan to destroy
    Magnus, so if you could, please move along.'
  - 'Ponter: We have just witnessed our town getting burned to dust, so let us be
    alone.'
  - 'Deserter: Wait, I;''ve heard about you! You must be !<NAME>! and Ponter! Is
    that correct?'
  - '!<NAME>! Yes, it is. How do you know us?'
  - 'Deserter: You see, we share the exact same mission. For 3 years now I''ve been
    trying to find the remnants of Magnus'' family.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Why is that?'
  - 'Deserter: At this point, what was left of human Magnus is completely gone, or
    buried deep inside him  He''s a full on demon.'
  - 'Deserter: I''ve travelled to many continents, and I learned a lot about demons,
    or more like humans, that plan to become them.'
  - 'Deserter: For a human to become a demon, they must sacrifice part of their soul
    and place it inside family''s blood, and then sacrifice them.'
  - 'Deserter: Magnus sacrificed his father and I''ve finally found out where he''s
    buried.'
  - 'Deserter: He''s buried right here! All we have to do is burn his body.'
  - '!<NAME>!: What? How are you so sure?'
  - 'Deserter: I''ve developed a magic DNA tracker, that let''s me find people that
    share the sample''s genetic code.'
  - 'Deserter: I''ve already found his mother''s and sister''s bodies but they didn''t
    contain Magnus'' soul. So it must be the father, and the device led me here.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Ponter, do you think we can trust him? I don''t trust myself anymore,
    it''s your call.'
  - 'Ponter: Hm... I don''t want to be mean to you, but I told you I had a bad feeling
    about what''s going to happen.'
  - 'Ponter: This, however... This looks like a good shot to me.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Alright, then.'
  deserterComing: {fileID: 948290303}
  sceneLoader: {fileID: 317006677}
